&lt;table cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; hspace=&quot;0&quot; vspace=&quot;0&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;
 &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
  &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-top:0cm;padding-right:9.0pt;
  padding-bottom:0cm;padding-left:9.0pt&quot;&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Drainage (Foul and
  Surface Water) – Pre-Commencement Condition&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;No development hereby
  permitted shall commence, including any works of demolition or site
  preparation, until full details of foul water drainage, surface water
  drainage, and surface water attenuation and storage have been submitted to
  and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The submitted details
  shall include:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
   &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Measures for the
       disposal of sewage (foul water);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
   &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Surface water
       drainage strategy;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
   &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Surface water
       attenuation and storage arrangements, including allowable discharge
       rates.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The approved drainage
  works shall be implemented in full prior to the first occupation of the
  development and shall thereafter be retained and maintained for the lifetime
  of the development.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
